{
  "name": "Order Shipped → SMS from a Stored Template (Bird)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Order Shipped → SMS from a Stored Template\n\nYour system posts an order to the webhook; Bird sends the shipping SMS from a template stored in Bird, so the copy and its translations live outside the workflow.\n\n**Bird operations:** `sms › send`",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-460, -80],
      "name": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Setup\n\n1. Add your **Bird API** credential; the key needs the `sms` scope.\n2. Create the SMS template in Bird and put its slug in **Template → Slug**.\n3. Add one **Parameters** row per template variable.\n\n**Note:** a template supplies the sender and the copy, so `Text`, `From` and `Category` must be left empty when you use one.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-460, 220],
      "name": "Setup Instructions"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "order-shipped",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "name": "Order Shipped",
      "webhookId": ""
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "sms",
        "operation": "send",
        "to": "={{ $json[\"body\"][\"phone\"] }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "template": {
            "slug": "order-shipped",
            "parameters": {
              "pairs": [
                {
                  "key": "order_id",
                  "value": "={{ $json[\"body\"][\"order_id\"] }}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "tracking_url",
                  "value": "={{ $json[\"body\"][\"tracking_url\"] }}"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "@messagebird/n8n-nodes-bird.bird",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 0],
      "name": "Send Shipping SMS",
      "credentials": {
        "birdApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "Bird account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Order Shipped": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Shipping SMS",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
